{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# Perturbative twist expansion — gl(4), L = 2, `[S,S,0,0] x [P,P,0,0]`\n\nSelf-contained. The twist is switched on along a **unimodular** ray `z_j = Exp[I eps psi_j]`,\n`Sum_j psi_j = 0`, so `z_1 z_2 z_3 z_4 = 1` exactly and `phi_j = I eps psi_j`.\n\n**What this notebook does.** Solves the twisted Baxter equation as a power series in the twist,\none order at a time, from the untwisted solution, on both the direct and the dual side, and fixes\nthe transfer matrix `tau` order by order.\n\n1. twist, Yangian weights, `tau_a` with its five free coefficients `tc`;\n2. the Baxter residual, one operator used at every order;\n3. the **untwisted** problem (`eps = 0`): four polynomial solutions of staggered degrees\n   `Mhat_k = M_k + (k-1)` sharing one `tau`, solved from scratch — this fixes `tc0` and `P_1..P_4`;\n4. `Bax[n][f]` — the Baxter operator applied to `f`, truncated at `eps^n`;\n5. `pushQ12` — branches 1 and 2 alone, `Q_k = Exp[phi_k u] q_k` with `q_k` monic of **fixed**\n   degree `M_k` and Laurent coefficients from `eps^{-(M_k-M_1)}`;\n6. `BaxD`, `pushQ34` — the dual side, `Q^j = Exp[-phi_j u] q^j`, `deg q^j = mu_j`;\n7. cross-check against the **exact** pseudovacuum `tau`.\n\n**Main result.** Two branches alone determine the whole transfer matrix, with a one-order lag:\npushing to `eps^N` fixes all five `tc` completely at orders `1 .. N-1`, and only the top order keeps\nfree directions. Verified against the exact `tau` at every order, on both the direct and dual sides.\n\n## Conventions and structure\n\n`Q_k = z_k^{u/h} q_k` with `q_k` monic of degree `M_k = (S+P) - mu_k`; the exponential is kept\n**exact** and expanded by `Bax`, never re-expanded into the polynomial. The `q_k` coefficients are\n**Laurent**: branch `k` diverges as `eps^{-(M_k - M_1)}`. On the dual side\n`Prod_{i != j} z_i = 1/z_j`, so `Q^j = Exp[-phi_j u] q^j` with `deg q^j = mu_j` — the same structure\nwith `mu_j` in place of `M_k` and the shifts reversed.\n\nThe staggered untwisted degrees `Mhat_k = M_k + (k-1)` are the shadow of this: expanding\n`Exp[phi u]` into polynomials is what raises the degree, so the untwisted `P_k` are limits of\n*combinations* of branches, not of the individual `Q_k`.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {
    "toolId": "W6sZmlsZQ"
   }
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 1. Parameters, twist, Yangian weights, transfer matrices --------------------------------\n   z_j = Exp[I eps psi_j] with Sum psi_j = 0, so the twist is unimodular EXACTLY, at every order.\n   chi_a are the elementary symmetric polynomials of the z_j (the twist characters).\n   nu_i(u) = Prod_alpha (u - theta_alpha - h lambda^alpha_i); the rectangular reps collapse these\n   to two distinct functions, nu_1 = nu_2 and nu_3 = nu_4. ---- *)\nClearAll[psi, zt, prm, z, χ, ν, ν1, qdet, Ξ, subl, τ, τ3quad, tc, tcvars, Mdeg, Mhat];\npsi = {1, 1/3, 1/5, -(1 + 1/3 + 1/5)};\nprm = {θ1 -> 1/3, θ2 -> 1/7, h -> 1};\nzt[j_] := Exp[I eps psi[[j]]];\n\nχ[a_] := χ[a] = Total[(Times @@ #) & /@ Subsets[Table[z[j], {j, 4}], {a}]];\nν[S_, P_][i_][u_] := (u - θ1 - h {S, S, 0, 0}[[i]]) (u - θ2 - h {P, P, 0, 0}[[i]]);\nν1[S_, P_][u_] := ν[S, P][1][u];\nqdet[S_, P_][u_] := χ[4] Product[ν[S, P][i][u - (4 - i) h], {i, 4}];\n\n(* subleading coefficient of tau_a: a twist prefactor times chi_a, plus h times the Cartan weights\n   acting on chi_a. Xi_a = Sum_i n_i z_i d(chi_a)/d(z_i). *)\nΞ[a_, n_List] := Total[((Times @@ (z /@ #)) Total[n[[#]]]) & /@ Subsets[Range[4], {a}]];\nsubl[a_, n_List] := -a (θ1 + θ2 + (a - 1) h) χ[a] - h Ξ[a, n];\n\ntcvars = Table[tc[i], {i, 5}];\nτ[1][S_, P_, μ_][u_] := χ[1] u^2 + subl[1, μ] u + tc[1];\nτ[2][S_, P_, μ_][u_] := χ[2] u^4 + subl[2, μ] u^3 + tc[2] u^2 + tc[3] u + tc[4];\nτ3quad[S_, P_, μ_] := τ3quad[S, P, μ] = Module[{x, bb, expr}, expr = Expand[ν[S, P][1][x - 2 h] ν[S, P][4][x] (χ[3] x^2 + bb x + tc[5])]; Simplify[bb /. First@Solve[Coefficient[expr, x, 5] == subl[3, μ], bb]]];\nτ[3][S_, P_, μ_][u_] := ν[S, P][1][u - 2 h] ν[S, P][4][u] (χ[3] u^2 + τ3quad[S, P, μ] u + tc[5]);\nτ[4][S_, P_, μ_][u_] := qdet[S, P][u];\n\nMdeg[S_, P_, μ_List] := (S + P) - μ;\nMhat[S_, P_, μ_List] := Mdeg[S, P, μ] + Range[0, 3];\n\n{\"psi\" -> psi, \"Sum psi\" -> Total[psi], \"unimodular\" -> Simplify[Product[zt[j], {j, 4}]] === 1}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"51807\" data-output-id=\"0\" data-out-n=\"19\" data-sub-idx=\"20\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"1\" data-sub-start=\"30\" data-sub-end=\"30\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[19]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"16\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"XGJlZ2lue2FsaWduZWR9CiAgJlxsZWZ0XHtcdGV4dHtwc2l9XHRvIFxsZWZ0XHsxLFxmcmFjezF9ezN9LFxmcmFjezF9ezV9LC1cZnJhY3syM317MTV9XHJpZ2h0XH0sXHRleHR7U3VtIHBzaX1cdG8gMCBccmlnaHQuIFxcCiAgJlxsZWZ0LiAsXHRleHR7dW5pbW9kdWxhcn1cdG8gXG1hdGhybXtUcnVlfVxyaWdodFx9ClxlbmR7YWxpZ25lZH0=\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.2em;vertical-align:-1.85em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.35em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.26em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.85em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.35em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">psi</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">23</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">}</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Sum psi</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.26em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">unimodular</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.85em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
