   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Leading behaviour of the norm — the Appendix N statement for this setup\n\nMeasured on **nine states across three `(S,P)`**, the norm determinant vanishes as\n\n$$\\det \\mathcal M^{AA} \\ \\sim\\ \\varepsilon^{\\,\\nu}\\ ,\\qquad \\nu \\;=\\; \\sum_{i<j}(\\mu_i-\\mu_j)\\;+\\;8 \\;=\\; 3\\mu_1+\\mu_2-\\mu_3-3\\mu_4+8\\ .$$\n\nThe first piece is exactly the exponent of Appendix L/N of `2603.26617` (`nu = -Sum_{j<k}(lambda_j-lambda_k)`); the `+8` is the price of the monic normalisation used here.\n\nThe full twist dependence factorises, verified on two independent unimodular rays and four states:\n\n$$\\det \\mathcal M^{AA} \\;=\\; \\underbrace{(\\phi_1-\\phi_2)^4(\\phi_3-\\phi_4)^4 \\prod_{i<j}(\\phi_i-\\phi_j)^{\\mu_i-\\mu_j}}_{\\text{explicit twist factor}} \\;\\times\\; \\mathcal N_{\\text{untw}} \\;+\\;\\dots$$\n\nwith `phi_i - phi_j = I eps (psi_i - psi_j)`. The `Prod (phi_i-phi_j)^{mu_i-mu_j}` is the `(L1)`\nprefactor of the paper; the extra `(phi_1-phi_2)^4 (phi_3-phi_4)^4` are the two divided differences\n(one per side), each entering the 4 rows that carry the second branch.\n\n`N_untw` is **twist-independent**: computed from two different rays it agrees to the truncation\nnoise. It is the untwisted content — the analogue of Appendix N's reduced determinant.\n\nIn the **regular basis** (divided differences instead of monic branches) the `+8` disappears, the\norder is exactly `Sum_{i<j}(mu_i-mu_j)`, and the entry orders show the Appendix N pattern directly:\nthe `alpha=1` rows are suppressed, `beta`-dependently, while every `alpha=2` row is `O(1)`.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* The exponent, over nine states and three (S,P). Order read numerically (log-log slope); sumDiff is Sum_{i<j}(mu_i - mu_j). The last column must be a constant 8. *)\nClearAll[sumDiff, normOrd];\nsumDiff[μ_] := Total[Abs[Flatten[Table[μ[[i]] - μ[[j]], {i, 4}, {j, i + 1, 4}]]]];\nordNumD[M_] := Round[-Differences[Log[10, Table[Abs[Det[N[M /. eps -> e, 60]]], {e, {1/100, 1/1000, 1/10000}}]]], 0.01];\nnormOrd[S_, P_, μ_, Nord_, Ntr_] := Module[{rdir, rdul, M}, SetState[S, P, μ]; rdir = pushQ12[S, P, μ, Nord]; rdul = pushQ34[S, P, μ, Nord]; M = spMat[S, P, dulQ[rdul, μ, Nord, Ntr], dirQ[rdir, S, P, μ, Nord, Ntr], Ntr]; ordNumD[M][[1]]];\nGrid[Prepend[Flatten[Table[With[{o = normOrd[sp[[1]], sp[[2]], μ, 10, 6]}, {sp, μ, Mdeg[sp[[1]], sp[[2]], μ], o, sumDiff[μ], o - sumDiff[μ]}], {sp, {{1, 1}, {2, 1}, {2, 2}}}, {μ, Switch[sp, {1, 1}, {{2, 2, 0, 0}, {2, 1, 1, 0}, {1, 1, 1, 1}}, {2, 1}, {{3, 3, 0, 0}, {3, 2, 1, 0}, {2, 2, 1, 1}}, {2, 2}, {{4, 4, 0, 0}, {4, 3, 1, 0}, {2, 2, 2, 2}}]}], 1], {\"(S,P)\", \"mu\", \"M\", \"order of det\", \"Sum(mu_i-mu_j)\", \"difference\"}], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
