  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* The twist prefactor. Compare the leading coefficient on two independent unimodular rays against (psi_1-psi_2)^4 (psi_3-psi_4)^4 Prod (psi_i-psi_j)^(mu_i-mu_j), and extract N_untw, which must come out ray-independent. NB do not call a pattern variable N: the built-in N[] is needed here. *)\nClearAll[L1fac, cand, leadC, prefTest];\nL1fac[ps_, μ_] := Product[(ps[[i]] - ps[[j]])^(μ[[i]] - μ[[j]]), {i, 4}, {j, i + 1, 4}];\ncand[ps_, μ_] := (ps[[1]] - ps[[2]])^4 (ps[[3]] - ps[[4]])^4 L1fac[ps, μ];\nleadC[S_, P_, μ_, Nord_, Ntr_, ord_] := Module[{rdir, rdul, M, e = 1/10000}, SetState[S, P, μ]; rdir = pushQ12[S, P, μ, Nord]; rdul = pushQ34[S, P, μ, Nord]; M = spMat[S, P, dulQ[rdul, μ, Nord, Ntr], dirQ[rdir, S, P, μ, Nord, Ntr], Ntr]; N[Det[N[M /. eps -> e, 80]]/e^ord, 30]];\npsiA = {1, 1/3, 1/5, -23/15}; psiB = {2, -1/2, 1/3, -(2 - 1/2 + 1/3)};\nprefTest[S_, P_, μ_, ord_] := Module[{ca, cb}, psi = psiA; ca = leadC[S, P, μ, 10, 6, ord]; psi = psiB; cb = leadC[S, P, μ, 10, 6, ord]; psi = psiA; {μ, ord, N[Abs[(cb/ca)/(cand[psiB, μ]/cand[psiA, μ]) - 1], 3], N[ca/cand[psiA, μ], 8], N[cb/cand[psiB, μ], 8]}];\nGrid[Prepend[{prefTest[1, 1, {2, 2, 0, 0}, 16], prefTest[1, 1, {2, 1, 1, 0}, 14], prefTest[1, 1, {1, 1, 1, 1}, 8], prefTest[2, 1, {3, 2, 1, 0}, 18]}, {\"mu\", \"order\", \"rel. error of prefactor\", \"N_untw (ray A)\", \"N_untw (ray B)\"}], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
