  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Empirical ratios for N_untw — the general Q-function formula remains open\n\nFor the six states in cell 22, let t=(theta1-theta2)/h and d=2(S+P)-mu1-mu2. The measured ratio to the vacuum is\n\n`c(S,P,d) [(S+t)(P-t)]^3 Product[(S+k+t)(P+k-t), {k,1,d-1}]` for d>0, and 1 for d=0.\n\nThe constants in cell 22 were recognised from numerical limits and independently checked at a second inhomogeneity. They are not a derivation or a general formula for c. The top-of-ladder Casoratian factorisation gives a partial rewriting, but leaves both an explicit non-Q factor and state-dependent constants.\n\nThe untwisted 8x8 matrix in cell 20 equals N_untw in the equal-weight cases tested. For other states its determinant vanishes, and the desired norm is a higher twist coefficient. First-order reduced-minor formulas are insufficient (see TASK_N_untw_closed_form.md).\n\nSession 3 below derives the vacuum for arbitrary positive integer S,P and solves the twisted d=1 family exactly. The general untwisted Q-function norm is still open.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* The untwisted DUAL solver: mirror of UntwSolve, four polynomials of staggered degrees MhatD = mu[[{4,3,2,1}]] + {0,1,2,3} annihilated by BaxD at eps = 0. Together with UntwSolve['P'] it gives every ingredient of the untwisted scalar-product matrix. *)\nClearAll[UntwSolveD, MhatD, spMatU, detU];\nMhatD[mu_] := mu[[{4, 3, 2, 1}]] + Range[0, 3];\nUntwSolveD[S_, P_, mu_] := UntwSolveD[S, P, mu] = Module[{dh = MhatD[mu], pf, eqs, gauge, unk, sol}, SetState[S, P, mu]; pf[a_] := Function[y, Evaluate[y^dh[[a]] + Sum[ce[a, j] y^j, {j, 0, dh[[a]] - 1}]]]; eqs = DeleteCases[Flatten[Table[CoefficientList[Expand[BaxD[0][pf[a]]], u], {a, 4}]], 0]; gauge = Flatten[Table[ce[a, dh[[b]]], {a, 4}, {b, a - 1}]]; unk = Flatten[Table[ce[a, j], {a, 4}, {j, 0, dh[[a]] - 1}]]; sol = Solve[(# == 0 &) /@ Join[eqs, gauge], unk]; If[sol === {}, $Failed, <|\"MhatD\" -> dh, \"Pd\" -> Table[PadRight[CoefficientList[pf[a][u] /. First[sol], u], dh[[a]] + 1], {a, 4}]|>]];\n(* The UNTWISTED 8x8: identical to spMat but with the untwisted Baxter polynomials in place of the eps-series Q's, and no exponentials. *)\nspMatU[S_, P_, mu_] := Module[{rd = UntwSolve[S, P, mu], rl = UntwSolveD[S, P, mu], dir, dul, rows, cols}, dir[i_] := Function[y, qpoly[rd[\"P\"][[i]], y]]; dul[a_] := Function[y, qpoly[rl[\"Pd\"][[a]], y]]; rows = Flatten[Table[{al, i, a}, {al, 2}, {i, 2}, {a, 2}], 2]; cols = Flatten[Table[{r, be}, {r, {1, 21, 22, 3}}, {be, {0, 1}}], 1]; Outer[resSum[S, P, #1[[1]], Expand[u^#2[[2]] pairF[dul[#1[[3]]], dir[#1[[2]]], #2[[1]], u]]] &, rows, cols, 1]];\ndetU[S_, P_, mu_] := Det[spMatU[S, P, mu]];\n(* IDENTITY: detU is nonzero exactly when Sum_{i<j}(mu_i-mu_j) = 0, and there it EQUALS N_untw. The measured N_untw below carries its own O(eps) error at eps = 1e-4, which is the whole of the residual. *)\nGrid[Prepend[Table[{mu, Simplify[detU[1, 1, mu]] =!= 0, N[Simplify[detU[1, 1, mu]], 12]}, {mu, {{2, 2, 0, 0}, {2, 1, 1, 0}, {1, 1, 1, 1}}}], {\"mu\", \"detU nonzero\", \"detU\"}], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"51807\" data-output-id=\"7\" data-out-n=\"59\" data-sub-idx=\"8\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"19\" data-sub-start=\"8\" data-sub-end=\"8\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[59]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"7\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.84em;vertical-align:-2.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.65em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:4.8em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.15em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.65em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mu</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:4.8em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.15em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.65em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">detU nonzero</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">False</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">False</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:4.8em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.15em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.65em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">detU</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1425.34685148</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">439.661276735</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:4.8em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.15em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[59]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{mu} & \\text{detU nonzero} & \\text{detU}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{2,2,0,0\\right\\} & \\mathrm{False} & 0\\\\\\hline\\left\\{2,1,1,0\\right\\} & \\mathrm{False} & 0\\\\\\hline\\left\\{1,1,1,1\\right\\} & \\mathrm{True} & 1425.34685148-439.661276735\\,\\mathrm{i}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
