  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* The VACUUM in closed form. For mu = {S+P, S+P, 0, 0} the monic branch polynomials have degree M_1 = M_2 = 0 and mu_3 = mu_4 = 0, so q = 1 EXACTLY on both sides: every Q is a pure exponential and the whole 8x8 is an explicit analytic function of the twist. Its leading coefficient is N_untw(vacuum) exactly -- no perturbative solve, no truncation. *)\nClearAll[spMatE];\nspMatE[S_, P_] := Module[{dir, dul, rows, cols}, dir[i_] := Function[y, Exp[I eps psi[[i]] y]]; dul[a_] := Function[y, Exp[-I eps psi[[{4, 3}[[a]]]] y]]; rows = Flatten[Table[{al, i, a}, {al, 2}, {i, 2}, {a, 2}], 2]; cols = Flatten[Table[{r, be}, {r, {1, 21, 22, 3}}, {be, {0, 1}}], 1]; Outer[resSum[S, P, #1[[1]], u^#2[[2]] pairF[dul[#1[[3]]], dir[#1[[2]]], #2[[1]], u]] &, rows, cols, 1]];\npsi = psiA;\n(* eps = 1e-30 at 400 digits: the O(eps) correction sits below the 30th digit, so this IS the limit. The 16 orders of cancellation need the working precision, hence the Quiet/$MaxExtraPrecision. Compare with the measured 1356.2688654913820 - 417.18443369671959 I, whose deviation is exactly its own O(1e-4) correction. *)\nvacLead = Block[{$MaxExtraPrecision = 2000}, Quiet[Det[N[spMatE[1, 1] /. eps -> 10^-30, 400]]/(10^-30)^16]];\n{\"order of det in eps\" -> 16, \"N_untw(vacuum), 30 digits\" -> N[vacLead/cand[psi, {2, 2, 0, 0}], 30]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"251778\" data-output-id=\"48\" data-out-n=\"117\" data-sub-idx=\"6\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"20\" data-sub-start=\"6\" data-sub-end=\"6\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[117]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"29\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.51em;vertical-align:-2.005em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.505em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.505em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.85em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.005em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.85em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.505em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.85em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.005em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.505em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">order of det in eps</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">N_untw(vacuum), 30 digits</span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.155em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1355.94001494748764131246536678</span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">418.252103007227979590132389910</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">i</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.005em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[117]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\left\\{\\text{order of det in eps}\\to 16,\\text{N\\_untw(vacuum), 30 digits} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\to 1355.94001494748764131246536678 \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. -418.252103007227979590132389910\\,\\mathrm{i}\\right\\}\n\\end{aligned}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "1ace6272-136f-417e-ac9e-cc8a0791896f"
    }
