  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* EMPIRICAL TABLE (superseded in part by the exact session-3 results). t = (theta1-theta2)/h, d = M_1+M_2 = deg Q_12. Ratio to the vacuum = c(S,P,d) [(S+t)(P-t)]^3 Prod_{k=1}^{d-1} (S+k+t)(P+k-t). The 'measured' column is the Richardson extrapolation of Det[spMat]/eps^ord to eps = 0 (cell 22), recognised as an exact rational; the last column is the factorisation of the monic untwisted Casoratian at the TOP of each ladder, which is what turns the formula into a product of Q-functions. *)\nClearAll[closed, Cst, q12mon, qfac, Wuntw];\nWuntw[S_, P_, mu_] := Module[{r = UntwSolve[S, P, mu], p1, p2, y, hh = h /. prm}, p1[yy_] := qpoly[r[\"P\"][[1]], yy]; p2[yy_] := qpoly[r[\"P\"][[2]], yy]; Expand[p1[y] p2[y - hh] - p1[y - hh] p2[y]]];\ntsym = (θ1 - θ2)/h /. prm;\nCst[S_, P_, d_] := Switch[{S, P, d}, {1, 1, 0}, 1, {1, 1, 1}, 1/32, {1, 1, 2}, 8/27, {2, 1, 0}, 1, {2, 1, 1}, 8/243, {2, 1, 2}, 6/5];\nclosed[S_, P_, mu_] := Module[{d = Total[(Mdeg[S, P, mu])[[1 ;; 2]]]}, Cst[S, P, d] Product[((S + k + tsym) (P + k - tsym))^If[k == 0, 3, 1], {k, 0, d - 1}]];\nq12mon[S_, P_, mu_] := Module[{w = Wuntw[S, P, mu], v}, v = Variables[w]; If[v === {}, 1 &, Function[Y, Evaluate[Expand[(w/Coefficient[w, v[[1]], Exponent[w, v[[1]]]]) /. v[[1]] -> Y]]]]];\nqfac[S_, P_, mu_] := Module[{f = q12mon[S, P, mu], d = Total[(Mdeg[S, P, mu])[[1 ;; 2]]]}, {Simplify[f[(θ1 /. prm) + S (h /. prm)]/Product[(S + k + tsym), {k, 0, d - 1}]], Simplify[f[(θ2 /. prm) + P (h /. prm)]/Product[(P + k - tsym), {k, 0, d - 1}]]}];\nmeas = {{1, 1, {2, 2, 0, 0}, 1}, {1, 1, {2, 1, 1, 0}, 76765625/2744515872}, {1, 1, {1, 1, 1, 1}, 1073490500000/1021217202747}, {2, 1, {3, 3, 0, 0}, 1}, {2, 1, {3, 2, 1, 0}, 3825694144/20841167403}, {2, 1, {2, 2, 1, 1}, 2435054322656/63038098935}};\nGrid[Prepend[Map[Function[w, {{w[[1]], w[[2]]}, w[[3]], Total[(Mdeg[w[[1]], w[[2]], w[[3]]])[[1 ;; 2]]], w[[4]], Simplify[closed[w[[1]], w[[2]], w[[3]]]], Simplify[closed[w[[1]], w[[2]], w[[3]]] - w[[4]]] === 0, qfac[w[[1]], w[[2]], w[[3]]]}], meas], {\"(S,P)\", \"mu\", \"d\", \"measured ratio (exact)\", \"closed form\", \"match\", \"Qbar12 top-of-ladder / product\"}], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
