  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* HOW THE 'measured' COLUMN OF CELL 22 WAS OBTAINED. Det[spMat]/eps^ord still carries an O(eps) correction; at eps = 1e-4 that is a relative 1e-3, which is why the earlier table only had ~8 good digits. Evaluating at eps = 1e-6 .. 1e-12 with 500-600 digits of working precision (the leading order is 12-20, so the determinant is ~1e-120 and the cancellations need the precision) and fitting a degree-6 polynomial in eps kills the corrections and leaves 30+ digits -- enough to recognise the limit as an exact rational. Cross-check: for the vacuum this reproduces the closed-form spMatE value of cell 21 to 29 digits. RUNTIME ~20 min for all six states; that is why the results are hard-coded in cell 22. *)\nClearAll[detAt, richard];\ndetAt[S_, P_, mu_, Nord_, Ntr_, e_, pr_] := Module[{rdir, rdul, M}, SetState[S, P, mu]; rdir = pushQ12[S, P, mu, Nord]; rdul = pushQ34[S, P, mu, Nord]; M = spMat[S, P, dulQ[rdul, mu, Nord, Ntr], dirQ[rdir, S, P, mu, Nord, Ntr], Ntr]; Det[N[M /. eps -> e, pr]]];\nrichard[vals_, es_] := Module[{n = Length[vals], y}, Fit[Transpose[{es, vals}], Table[y^k, {k, 0, n - 1}], y] /. y -> 0];\nNuntwExact[S_, P_, mu_, ord_] := Module[{es = Table[10^-k, {k, 6, 12}]}, richard[Table[detAt[S, P, mu, 12, 8, e, 600]/e^ord/cand[psi, mu], {e, es}], es]];\n(* The ratio to the vacuum is N_untw/I^nu with nu = Sum_{i<j}(mu_i-mu_j) + 8, and comes out EXACTLY REAL. Example (the state that was hardest to pin down): *)\n(* N[(NuntwExact[1,1,{2,1,1,0},14]/I^14)/(NuntwExact[1,1,{2,2,0,0},16]/I^16), 30]  ->  76765625/2744515872 *)\n\"Richardson machinery loaded (not evaluated -- see comment)\"",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Session 3: exact twisted degree-one solution and analytic confluence\n\nThe table above is empirical, not a general Q-function formula. We now solve the degree-one branches exactly in the twists and extract the determinant coefficient by exact arithmetic. All new checks are recorded below.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Check the retained live-kernel state before reusing it. *)\n{prm, psi, Length[DownValues[BaxRes]], Length[DownValues[spMatE]], Head[rA12], Head[rAd12], Length[DownValues[UntwSolveD]]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
