       "data": "Out[125]= \\left\\{\\left\\{-\\frac{z\\left(2\\right)\\,\\left(672\\,\\mathrm{exb}\\,z\\left(1\\right)^3-1344\\,z\\left(1\\right)^3-441\\,\\mathrm{exb}\\,\\mathrm{tc}\\left(1\\right)\\,z\\left(1\\right)^2+882\\,\\mathrm{tc}\\left(1\\right)\\,z\\left(1\\right)^2+64769\\,\\mathrm{exb}\\,z\\left(2\\right)\\,z\\left(1\\right)^2-59650\\,z\\left(2\\right)\\,z\\left(1\\right)^2-5119\\,\\mathrm{exb}\\,z\\left(3\\right)\\,z\\left(1\\right)^2+10238\\,z\\left(3\\right)\\,z\\left(1\\right)^2-3145\\,\\mathrm{exb}\\,z\\left(4\\right)\\,z\\left(1\\right)^2+6290\\,z\\left(4\\right)\\,z\\left(1\\right)^2+5119\\,\\mathrm{exb}\\,z\\left(2\\right)^2\\,z\\left(1\\right)-5119\\,z\\left(2\\right)^2\\,z\\left(1\\right)+441\\,\\mathrm{exb}\\,\\mathrm{tc}\\left(2\\right)\\,z\\left(1\\right)-882\\,\\mathrm{tc}\\left(2\\right)\\,z\\left(1\\right)-45864\\,\\mathrm{exb}\\,\\mathrm{tc}\\left(1\\right)\\,z\\left(2\\right)\\,z\\left(1\\right)+45864\\,\\mathrm{tc}\\left(1\\right)\\,z\\left(2\\right)\\,z\\left(1\\right)+4158\\,\\mathrm{exb}\\,z\\left(2\\right)\\,z\\left(3\\right)\\,z\\left(1\\right)-3197\\,z\\left(2\\right)\\,z\\left(3\\right)\\,z\\left(1\\right)+2394\\,\\mathrm{exb}\\,z\\left(2\\right)\\,z\\left(4\\right)\\,z\\left(1\\right)-1643\\,z\\left(2\\right)\\,z\\left(4\\right)\\,z\\left(1\\right)-1423\\,\\mathrm{exb}\\,z\\left(3\\right)\\,z\\left(4\\right)\\,z\\left(1\\right)+3518\\,z\\left(3… [latex truncated: 46627 chars total]",
