  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Exact solution for the whole d=1 family\n\nPut L=S+P and mu={L,L-1,1,0}. Let r be the root of\n\n`z2 (r-theta1-S h)(r-theta2-P h) = z3 (r-theta1)(r-theta2)`\n\nthat tends to `r0=(SP h+P theta1+S theta2)/L`. Then\n\n`q1=1`, `q2(u)=u-r+h z1/(z1-z2)`, `q^4=1`, `q^3(u)=u-r+h z4/(z3-z4)`.\n\nAll four Baxter residuals vanish identically modulo the quadratic equation, with symbolic S,P,h,theta1,theta2 and twists. The other algebraic root diverges as z2 approaches z3 and does not continue this untwisted irrep. This solves the exact twisted family, but is not yet the requested untwisted norm formula.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[exD1Mat, exD1Det];\nexD1Mat[S_, P_, ps_List] := Module[{rows, cols, zs = 1 + eps ps}, rows = Flatten[Table[{al, i, j}, {al, 2}, {i, 2}, {j, {4, 3}}], 2]; cols = Tuples[{{0, 1}, {0, 1}, {0, 1}}]; Outer[Function[{rr, cc}, With[{al = rr[[1]], i = rr[[2]], j = rr[[3]], sg = cc[[1]], tt = cc[[2]], be = cc[[3]]}, Together[Sum[With[{p = ({θ1, θ2}[[al]] + nn h) /. prm}, wE1[S, P, p] If[be == 0, 1, p] (zs[[i]]/zs[[j]])^nn zs[[j]]^-sg zs[[i]]^-tt If[i == 1, 1, p - tt - exRoot + zs[[1]]/(zs[[1]] - zs[[2]])] If[j == 4, 1, p + sg - exRoot + zs[[4]]/(zs[[3]] - zs[[4]])]], {nn, 0, {S, P}[[al]]}]]]], rows, cols, 1]];\nexD1Det[S_, P_, ps_List] := Module[{mat = exD1Mat[S, P, ps], den, pol, dd, req}, den = PolynomialLCM @@ (Denominator[Together[#]] & /@ #) & /@ mat; pol = MapThread[Cancel[#1 #2] &, {mat, den}]; dd = Det[pol]; req = exRootEq /. {exS -> S, exP -> P} /. prm /. Table[z[j] -> 1 + eps ps[[j]], {j, 4}]; Factor[PolynomialRemainder[dd, req, exRoot]/Times @@ den]];\nexD11 = TimeConstrained[exD1Det[1, 1, {3, 1, -1, -3}], 40, $Aborted];\n{Head[exD11], LeafCount[exD11]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"251778\" data-output-id=\"60\" data-out-n=\"175\" data-sub-idx=\"4\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"34\" data-sub-start=\"4\" data-sub-end=\"4\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[175]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"14\" data-latex-b64=\"XGxlZnRce1xtYXRocm17VGltZXN9LDU1XHJpZ2h0XH0=\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Times</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">55</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
