  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* A direct three-variable determinant (eps, root, symbolic t) exceeded 40 s for each test. Use exact rational parameters first; the general d=1 coefficient is not proved by these samples alone. *)\nexD1Samples = Table[With[{S = sp[[1]], P = sp[[2]]}, Module[{aa = exD1Lead[sp[[1]], sp[[2]], {3, 1, -1, -3}], vv = exVacLead[sp[[1]], sp[[2]], {3, 1, -1, -3}], tt = (θ1 - θ2)/h /. prm, rat}, rat = Factor[aa[\"coefficient\"]/vv[\"coefficient\"]]; {sp, aa[\"order\"], rat, Factor[rat/((S + tt) (P - tt))^3], Factor[rat - (S P)^3/((S + P)^5) ((S + tt) (P - tt))^3] == 0}]], {sp, {{1, 1}, {2, 1}, {2, 2}, {3, 1}, {3, 2}}}];\nexD1Samples",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
