  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Match the exact d=1 branches against the independently saved exponential-ray perturbative solutions through eps^8. *)\nexJet8 = exRootJet[1, 1, psiA, 8, \"exponential\"];\nexBJet8 = Normal[Series[Exp[I eps psiA[[1]]]/(Exp[I eps psiA[[1]]] - Exp[I eps psiA[[2]]]), {eps, 0, 8}]] - exJet8;\nexCJet8 = Normal[Series[Exp[I eps psiA[[4]]]/(Exp[I eps psiA[[3]]] - Exp[I eps psiA[[4]]]), {eps, 0, 8}]] - exJet8;\nexSeriesCheck = {Expand[exBJet8 - Sum[eps^nn (qd[2, nn, 0] /. rA12[\"sol\"]), {nn, -1, 8}]] == 0, Expand[exCJet8 - Sum[eps^nn (qe[2, nn, 0] /. rAd12[\"sol\"]), {nn, -1, 8}]] == 0};\nexSeriesCheck",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
