\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 6016\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V6016 H384z M384 0 H504 V6016 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-15.166em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:8.016em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎫</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:7.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[287]= \\left\\{0,\\frac{\\textcolor{gray}{\\left[\\textcolor{black}{\\begin{gathered}\n  8\\,\\mathrm{exP}^3\\,\\left(\\mathrm{exP}+1\\right)\\,\\mathrm{exS}^3\\, \\\\\n  \\left(\\mathrm{exS}+1\\right)\\,\\left(\\mathrm{exP}-\\mathrm{exT}\\right)^3\\, \\\\\n  \\left(\\mathrm{exP}-\\mathrm{exT}+1\\right)\\, \\\\\n  \\left(\\mathrm{exS}+\\mathrm{exT}\\right)^3\\, \\\\\n  \\left(\\mathrm{exS}+\\mathrm{exT}+1\\right)\n\\end{gathered}}\\right]}}{\\textcolor{gray}{\\left[\\textcolor{black}{\\begin{gathered}\n  \\left(\\mathrm{exP}+\\mathrm{exS}+1\\right)^3\\, \\\\\n  \\left(\\mathrm{exP}+\\mathrm{exS}+2\\right)\n\\end{gathered}}\\right]}}\\right\\}",
