  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### d=2: general-spin formula derived\n\nFor L=S+P and mu={L-1,L-1,1,1}, the exact confluent determinant factors, with symbolic S,P,t, as\n\n`N/Nvac = 8 (SP)^3 (S+1)(P+1) h^8 /[(L+1)^3(L+2)] [(S+t)(P-t)]^3 (S+1+t)(P+1-t)`.\n\nEquivalently, using the monic direct P1 and monic Casoratian Qbar12,\n\n$$\\frac{N}{N_{\\rm vac}}=8(L+1)^3(L+2)\\frac{[\\bar Q_{12}(\\theta_1+Sh)\\bar Q_{12}(\\theta_2+Ph)]^3}{[P_1(\\theta_1+Sh)P_1(\\theta_2+Ph)]^2}.$$\n\nThis is now a general-spin derivation, not a fit. The first four rows are the total residue functional divided by (phi_i-phi_j)^(L-2); the residue functional kills all polynomials of degree <=L, so this quotient is analytic. The remaining confluence contributes four direct and four dual differences. Only the first branch derivatives survive; their differences are fixed by the untwisted P1,P2. The resulting 8x8 is d2Confluent, whose determinant was factored with symbolic spins and separation.\n\nFor the second ladder, normalised factorial moments are `(P falling k)((S+t) falling k)/(L falling k)`; ordinary moments follow by Stirling numbers. The generic calculation uses moments up to degree 5 and is valid for L>=5. The finitely many positive-spin cases L=2,3,4 were independently checked exactly above (and their exchanges follow by site symmetry).\n\nThe same analytic construction extends to mu={L-m,L-m,m,m}, d=2m. The next cells implement that closed determinant entirely in the untwisted P1,P2 and dual polynomials.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[balancedQNorm, balancedQMat];\nbalancedQMat[S_, P_, mm_] := Module[{mu = {S + P - mm, S + P - mm, mm, mm}, nn = S + P - 2 mm, pp, pd, aa, ad, rd, rl, hh = h /. prm, cols = Tuples[{{0, 1}, {0, 1}, {0, 1}}], top, low, v, w, uu, qd, ql}, pp = qpoly[#, uu] & /@ Take[UntwSolve[S, P, mu][\"P\"], 2]; pd = qpoly[#, uu] & /@ Take[UntwSolveD[S, P, mu][\"Pd\"], 2]; aa = If[mm == 0, 0, Coefficient[pp[[1]], uu, mm - 1]]; ad = If[mm == 0, 0, Coefficient[pd[[1]], uu, mm - 1]]; rd = Expand[pp[[2]] - (uu - aa) pp[[1]]]; rl = Expand[-pd[[2]] + (uu - ad) pd[[1]]]; top = Transpose[Table[Module[{sg = col[[1]], tt = col[[2]], be = col[[3]], ff, pol}, qd = (pp[[1]] + v rd) /. uu -> uu - col[[2]] hh; ql = (pd[[1]] + w rl) /. uu -> uu + col[[1]] hh; pol = Expand[uu^be qd ql]; ff = Sum[(v - w)^kk/(nn + kk)! resSum[S, P, 1, (uu^(nn + kk) pol) /. uu -> u], {kk, 0, 2}]; ff = Expand[(1 - tt hh v - sg hh w + (tt hh v + sg hh w)^2/2) ff]; {ff /. {v -> 0, w -> 0}, Coefficient[ff, w, 1] /. v -> 0, Coefficient[ff, v, 1] /. w -> 0, Coefficient[Coefficient[ff, v, 1], w, 1]}], {col, cols}]]; low = Transpose[Table[With[{sg = col[[1]], tt = col[[2]], be = col[[3]]}, Module[{qa = pp[[1]] /. uu -> uu - col[[2]] hh, qc = pd[[1]] /. uu -> uu + col[[1]] hh, ra = rd /. uu -> uu - col[[2]] hh, rc = rl /. uu -> uu + col[[1]] hh, pols}, pols = Expand /@ (uu^be {qa qc, qa ((-uu - sg hh) qc + rc), ((uu - tt hh) qa + ra) qc, ((uu - tt hh) qa + ra) ((-uu - sg hh) qc + rc)}); (Total[Table[With[{p = (θ2 + kk hh) /. prm}, wE1[S, P, p] (# /. uu -> p)], {kk, 0, P}]] &) /@ pols]], {col, cols}]]; Map[Factor, Join[top, low], {2}]];\nbalancedQNorm[S_, P_, mm_] := (Exp[2 Pi I (θ2/h /. prm)] - Exp[2 Pi I (θ1/h /. prm)])^4 Det[balancedQMat[S, P, mm]];\nbalEqualCheck = Simplify[balancedQNorm[2, 2, 2] - detU[2, 2, {2, 2, 2, 2}]];\nGrid[{{\"d=4 equal-weight norm residual\", balEqualCheck}}, Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"51807\" data-output-id=\"31\" data-out-n=\"183\" data-sub-idx=\"4\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"59\" data-sub-start=\"4\" data-sub-end=\"4\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[183]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"29\" data-latex-b64=\"XGJlZ2lue2FycmF5fXt8Y3xjfH1caGxpbmVcdGV4dHtkPTQgZXF1YWwtd2VpZ2h0IG5vcm0gcmVzaWR1YWx9ICYgMFxcXGhsaW5lXGVuZHthcnJheX0=\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.24em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.89em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:1.2em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">d=4 equal-weight norm residual</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:1.2em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:1.2em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.65em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
