      {
       "data": "Out[304]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\left\\{\\left\\{0,0\\right\\},\\left\\{\\frac{\\mathrm{exS}\\,\\left(\\mathrm{exS}+1\\right)\\,\\left(\\mathrm{exS}+\\mathrm{exT}\\right)\\,\\left(\\mathrm{exS}+\\mathrm{exT}+1\\right)}{\\left(\\mathrm{exP}+\\mathrm{exS}\\right)\\,\\left(\\mathrm{exP}+\\mathrm{exS}+1\\right)} \\right. \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\left. ,\\frac{\\mathrm{exP}\\,\\left(\\mathrm{exP}+1\\right)\\,\\left(\\mathrm{exP}-\\mathrm{exT}\\right)\\,\\left(\\mathrm{exP}-\\mathrm{exT}+1\\right)}{\\left(\\mathrm{exP}+\\mathrm{exS}\\right)\\,\\left(\\mathrm{exP}+\\mathrm{exS}+1\\right)} \\right. \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\left. ,\\frac{\\textcolor{gray}{\\left[\\textcolor{black}{\\begin{gathered}\n  \\left(\\mathrm{exS}-1\\right)\\,\\mathrm{exS}^2\\,\\left(\\mathrm{exS}+1\\right)\\,\\left(\\mathrm{exS}+\\mathrm{exT}-1\\right)\\, \\\\\n  \\left(\\mathrm{exS}+\\mathrm{exT}\\right)^2\\,\\left(\\mathrm{exS}+\\mathrm{exT}+1\\right)\n\\end{gathered}}\\right]}}{\\left(\\mathrm{exP}+\\mathrm{exS}-1\\right)\\,\\left(\\mathrm{exP}+\\mathrm{exS}\\right)^2\\,\\left(\\mathrm{exP}+\\mathrm{exS}+1\\right)} \\right. \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\left. ,\\frac{\\textcolor{gray}{\\left[\\textcolor{black}{\\begin{gathered}\n  \\left(\\mathrm{exP}-1\\right)\\,\\mathrm{exP}^2\\,\\left(\\mathrm{exP}+1\\right)\\,\\left(\\mathrm{exP}-\\mathrm{exT}-1\\right)\\, \\\\\n  \\… [latex truncated: 1462 chars total]",
