      {
       "data": "Out[86]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{second ray and order-6 jet residual} & 0\\\\\\hline\\text{S,P,k; norm/vac; ratio to cubic Q12 pairing} & \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline1 & 1 & 1 & \\frac{76765625}{2744515872} & 2\\\\\\hline2 & 1 & 1 & \\frac{3825694144}{20841167403} & 24\\\\\\hline2 & 2 & 2 & \\frac{1640027258356000000}{1787466085266953763} & 96\\\\\\hline3 & 2 & 2 & \\frac{986519036609851256}{66202447602479769} & 3000\\\\\\hline3 & 3 & 3 & \\frac{395723228945106720910203125}{280391463287429124350916} & 18000\\\\\\hline\\end{array}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
