       "data": "Out[162]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{second-ray and deeper-jet residual} & 0\\\\\\hline\\text{S,P,m,k; residual prefactor after the proposed products} & \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline3 & 2 & 1 & 1 & \\frac{1}{7875}\\\\\\hline4 & 2 & 1 & 1 & \\frac{1}{65536}\\\\\\hline4 & 3 & 1 & 1 & \\frac{3}{1071875}\\\\\\hline4 & 3 & 1 & 2 & \\frac{1}{3779136}\\\\\\hline4 & 3 & 2 & 1 & \\frac{2}{212625}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
