  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[univHahnOp,univHahnEigen,univFactorTc,uft];\nunivHahnOp[f_][y_] := (y-θ1-exS h)(y-θ2-exP h)(f[y+h]-f[y])+(y-θ1+h)(y-θ2+h)(f[y-h]-f[y]);\nunivHahnEigen[n_] := h^2 n(n-exS-exP-3);\nunivFactorTc=Module[{mu0={exS+exP-em,exS+exP-em-ek,em+ek,em},lam=univHahnEigen[em],lam2=univHahnEigen[em+ek+1],lhs,rhs,co,so},lhs=Cancel[BaxRes[exS,exP,mu0][1][f][x]/(ν1[exS,exP][x-2 h]ν1[exS,exP][x-3 h])]/.z1sub;rhs=Expand[univHahnOp[Function[y,univHahnOp[f][y]-lam2 f[y]]][x-h]-lam(univHahnOp[f][x-h]-lam2 f[x-h])];co=DeleteCases[Flatten[CoefficientList[Expand[Coefficient[lhs-rhs,#]],x]&/@Table[f[x+r h],{r,-3,1}]],0];so=Solve[Thread[co==0],tcvars];<|\"solutions\"->Length[so],\"rules\"->so,\"residual\"->If[so==={},Missing[\"NoFactorization\"],Factor[(lhs-rhs)/.First[so]]]|>];\nGrid[{{\"symbolic fourth-order Baxter factorization solutions\",univFactorTc[\"solutions\"]},{\"operator residual for arbitrary S,P,m,k,h,theta\",univFactorTc[\"residual\"]}},Frame->All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
